The Yenisei Kyrgyz corpus in this directory (YENISEI-KYRGYZ-CORPUS.md and
shapes.json) is adapted from A Database of Turkic Runiform Inscriptions,
Uppsala University, Department of Linguistics and Philology (project manager
László Károly), https://www.runiform.lingfil.uu.se/, which is licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). As an adaptation, the corpus carries the same
license.

The transliterations, readings, translations, comments, catalogue data and
glyph drawings belong to the database and its contributors. The Unicode
encoding, the glyph placements, and the notes are
Copyright (c) 2026 Emil Madraimov, and are licensed on the same terms.

You may share and adapt this material for noncommercial purposes, provided
